    "Golda does not recognise speech itself. To turn what you say into an operation, it sends the recording to Gemini, Google’s AI model." : {
      "comment" : "Voice consent: why the recording leaves the phone.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Golda does not recognise speech itself. To turn what you say into an operation, it sends the recording to Gemini, Google’s AI model."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Golda не распознаёт речь сама. Чтобы превратить сказанное в операцию, она отправляет запись в Gemini — модель ИИ от Google."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google handles the recording under the Gemini API terms. On the phone it is deleted as soon as the operation is saved." : {
